      "rationale": "Uses the existing state EventSource for the registered memory scope, ignores events from stopped/replaced sources, dispatches initial/change notices and separate errors to the watch owner, resets initial state on open and reopens/disposes the scope subscription. The watch owner invokes shared entry generation invalidation; this transport neither invents summary counts nor authenticates knowledge or opens a second memory connection.",
      "role": "propagation-persistence"
    }
