    "11": {
      "note": "attachReviewListeners now owns the guarded review.memory, review.memory.error and review.explainer.moved listeners. A current moved event marks watchdog liveness and publishes to the exact-scope moved-notice subscribers; it does not change snapshot/delta ownership. One isCurrent predicate excludes a stopped or replaced source for all state handlers. The memory initial-baseline flag is a shared mutable holder reset on open, preserving the prior reconciliation behavior.\n\nAnchor: `attachReviewListeners`, `connectState`",
